# Trading Safety

Read and obey `AGENTS.md` before any code change.

- Strategy code must only emit `LONG` / `SHORT` / `CLOSE` / `HOLD`. It must never place orders.
- All orders go through Trading Controller. Do not bypass it.
- At most one live position. With an open position, reject new `LONG` / `SHORT`.
- No automatic reverse: close first; a new open requires a later independent signal.
- Hyperliquid exchange state outranks local SQLite / cache.
- Recovery mode: no opens. Trading-related settings must persist.
- Never commit real keys. Never live-trade without explicit user confirmation.
- Do not weaken tests to hide product bugs.
- Each Phase ends with a report, then stop. Do not start the next Phase unasked.
